# "... until your next turn, if a source would deal damage to that player ..., it deals double that damage instead." Bot1's
# Lightning hits Bot2 for 3 (Bot2 to 17, Bot1 to 23 by lifelink). After combat Bot1's Lightning Bolt deals 3 doubled to 6 (Bot2
# to 11). On turn 4 any source counts, the opponent's too: Bot2's own Bolt at itself is doubled to 6 (Bot2 to 5), while its Bolt
# at Bot1 is a plain 3 (Bot1 to 20): the effect is about Bot2 only, not about Lightning's controller. At Bot1's next turn the
# effect ends: a Bolt on turn 5 deals 3 (Bot2 to 2).

